From: Sergey Fedorov <barracuda@macos-powerpc.org>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 20:34:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/16] Implement wp_single_pixel_buffer_v1

Vendor the staging single-pixel-buffer-v1 protocol. OwlSinglePixelBuffer
is a 1x1 OwlBuffer subclass that fills its rect with the requested
premultiplied RGBA color; mpv uses this for solid backgrounds.
